1
00:00:00,003 --> 00:00:02,293
(Sheldon:)Or in layman's terms, string theory.

2
00:00:03,298 --> 00:00:04,968
(Assistant:)I see.

3
00:00:05,133 --> 00:00:06,343
(Assistant:)Just give me a second.

4
00:00:10,305 --> 00:00:12,975
(Assistant:)Security!

5
00:00:18,021 --> 00:00:21,401
(Raj:)Okay.
I'll get those drinks started for you.

6
00:00:22,025 --> 00:00:23,695
(Sheldon(appearing in an apron and carrying a tray):)Behind you.

7
00:00:24,444 --> 00:00:27,034
Sheldon? What the hell are you doing?

8
00:00:27,197 --> 00:00:29,537
(Sheldon:)Trying to get these tables cleared.
We're slammed.

9
00:00:31,201 --> 00:00:34,041
(Penny:)No, wait. Wait. No, wait.
What are you doing here?

10
00:00:34,204 --> 00:00:35,874
(Sheldon:)A reasonable question.

11
00:00:36,039 --> 00:00:37,119
I asked myself:

12
00:00:37,290 --> 00:00:40,840
"What is the most mind-numbing,
pedestrian job conceivable?"

13
00:00:41,002 --> 00:00:42,382
(Sheldon:)Three answers came to mind.

14
00:00:42,546 --> 00:00:44,966
A toll booth attendant,
an Apple store genius...

15
00:00:47,467 --> 00:00:48,887
(Sheldon:)...and what Penny does.

16
00:00:49,052 --> 00:00:53,222
(Sheldon:)Now, since I don't like touching
other people's coins...

17
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:58,230
(Sheldon:)...and I refuse to contribute
to the devaluation of the word "genius"...

